  "body": "LOT-190\nRefs #731 (art only: registration in `AppIconOption`, `ASSETCATALOG_COMPILER_ALTERNATE_APPICON_NAMES` and thumbnails wait for #730, then this PR switches to `Closes #731`)\nClaim: mac/i731\n\n## Problem\n#731 needs the art of 20 alternate icons; #730 owns the pack field, windows and thumbnails.\n\n## What changed\n20 `App/SwiftHFR/Icon-<NAME>.icon` bundles (one layer per appearance, switched by `hidden-specializations`: Default, Dark, Tinted), from the operator-validated masters of `docs/assets/themes/icons/` (SVG rendered to 1024 px PNG, not redrawn). `Icon-CLASSIC-BLUE` is the legacy `Classic-Blue.appiconset` image @ 87fe0d1c, unchanged. CREDITS.md AlternativeIcons rows added.\n\n| Bundle | Master |\n|---|---|\n| `Icon-ORANGE` | `legacy-orange` |\n| `Icon-CLASSIC-BLUE` | legacy Classic-Blue 1024 px |\n| `Icon-BETA-RED` | `beta-red` |\n| `Icon-XFACE`, `-PRIDE`, `-PRIDE-OUTLINE`, `-GRADIENT-LIGHT`, `-GRADIENT-DARK`, `-GOLD`, `-GOLD-ON-BLACK`, `-GOLD-OUTLINE`, `-5250`, `-NEGATIVE`, `-NEGATIVE-INVERTED`, `-SUNSET` | `xface-red`, `xface-pride`, ... |\n| `Icon-HALLOWEEN-JACK`, `-HALLOWEEN-HFR`, `-SPRING`, `-SUMMER`, `-WINTER` | `halloween-jack`, `halloween-hfr`, `spring-sakura`, `summer-sun`, `winter-scarf` |\n\nFace check (ICONS.md section 4, first step): `Icon-REDFACE.icon/Assets/foreground.svg` ring = 86.7 % of the icon; the legacy `Icon-REDFACE@3x.png` @ 87fe0d1c measures 156/180 px = 86.67 %. Matches.\n\n## Not in this PR\nRegistration (`AppIconOption`, alternate names, thumbnails), screenshots on Home Screens, calendar test.\n\n## Tests\n`actool` compiles every new bundle (no error); readability at 29 pt checked on 87 px and 60 px renders. No app build yet.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CJ1auuPWv2FeT7Q4Ps\n",
